  "schema": {
    "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#",
    "additionalProperties": false,
    "definitions": {
      "mntent": {
        "additionalItems": false,
        "description": "An fstab entry",
        "properties": {
          "device": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "dump": {
            "minimum": 0,
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "fsck": {
            "minimum": 0,
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "fstype": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "options": {
            "items": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "minItems": 1,
            "type": "array"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "device",
          "fstype"
        ],
        "title": "mntent",
        "type": "object"
      }
    },
    "description": "JSON representation of /etc/fstab",
    "patternProperties": {
      "^/([^/]+(/[^/]+)*)?$": {
        "$ref": "#/definitions/mntent"
      }
    },
    "properties": {
      "swap": {
        "$ref": "#/definitions/mntent"
      }
    },
    "required": [
      "/",
      "swap"
    ],
    "title": "/etc/fstab",
    "type": "object"
  },
  "erroneous_json": {
    "/": {
      "device": "/dev/sda1",
      "fstype": "ext4",
      "options": [
        "defaults",
        "noatime"
      ],
      "dump": 1,
      "fsck": 1
    },
    "/home": {
      "device": "/dev/sdb1",
      "fstype": "ext4",
      "options": [
        "defaults"
      ],
      "dump": 1,
      "fsck": 2
    }
  },
  "valid_json": {
    "/": {
      "device": "/dev/sda1",
      "fstype": "ext4",
      "options": [
        "defaults",
        "noatime"
      ],
      "dump": 1,
      "fsck": 1
    },
    "swap": {
      "device": "/dev/sda2",
      "fstype": "swap",
      "options": [
        "pri=1"
      ],
      "dump": 0,
      "fsck": 0
    },
    "/home": {
      "device": "/dev/sdb1",
      "fstype": "ext4",
      "options": [
        "defaults"
      ],
      "dump": 1,
      "fsck": 2
    }
  },
  "description": "The system\u2019s root filesystem is mounted from **/dev/sda1** as an **ext4** volume. It uses the standard \u201cdefaults\u201d mount options supplemented with \u201cnoatime\u201d, and it is configured to be included in dump operations (dump\u202f=\u202f1) and to be checked by\u202ffsck on the first pass (fsck\u202f=\u202f1).  \n\nThe swap space resides on **/dev/sda2**, identified with the **swap** filesystem type. Its only option is \u201cpri=1\u201d, and it is excluded from dumps (dump\u202f=\u202f0) and not subject to fsck checks (fsck\u202f=\u202f0).  \n\nUser home directories are served from **/dev/sdb1**, also formatted as **ext4**. The mount uses the default options, is included in dump (dump\u202f=\u202f1), and will be examined by\u202ffsck on the second pass (fsck\u202f=\u202f2)."
}